// Allocataire: L. 513-1 (charge effective et permanente - organ judgment
// channel section 47.3), L. 512-1 (residence, personal-entitlement non-overlap, detaches),
// L. 512-2 (full entitlement of foreigners - regularite fact; title lists
// D. 512-1/2 out of scope, boundary B-PFCORE-DATES-MOIS), L. 512-4 (adoption),
// L. 512-5 (non-overlap with foreign benefits -> differentielle),
// L. 512-6 (DOM/metropole: entitlement through the metropolitan spouse).
//
// DEONTIC MAP:
// - L. 513-1 "sont dues" - institutional status allocataire; the fund
//   duty to pay - module 08 (DevoirPayerPrestations). Assessor of
//   "charge effective et permanente" - the organ: external judgment.
// - L. 512-1 para. 2 (detaches) - entitlement defeater, not a prohibition.
// - L. 512-5/6 "ne peuvent se cumuler" - no-overlap prohibition (prohibition
//   of the "cumuler" action), implemented as differentielle.
// - L. 512-4 "a la condition que" - filter conditions, case facts.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.pf.core version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:pf-core";

use self::{
    CSS_L512_1,
    CSS_L512_1_CSS_ED2021_05,
    CSS_L512_1_CSS_ED2021_11,
    CSS_L512_1_CSS_ED2021_12,
    CSS_L512_1_CSS_ED2022_01,
